  "body": "The `site` job of `release.yml` run 45742430230 (tag v0.27.0, commit f8748d97d) failed at the step \"Site tests\". Thus the `pages` job did not deploy the site. A user cannot see the 0.27.0 documentation on https://neotech.github.io/Camcraft/.\n\nThis is the same drift as #3763. The job log has 4 failures and 2 errors (104 tests).\n\nFailures:\n\n1. `test_first_4axis_part.py:173` and `test_first_continuous_4axis_part.py:165` (ERROR): the label `New tool…` points to `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tool_library.rs`. That file does not exist on the tag. The source of the label moved.\n2. `test_guide_icons.py:147` and `:155`: `site/static/icons/op-rotary-flow.png` and `site/static/icons/tool-form-mill.png` are missing. The app icons exist in `assets/ui/`.\n3. `test_operation_reference.py:61`: the operation reference has no section for `RotaryFlow`.\n\nCause: the features of 0.27.0 merged without their site pages, and a UI file moved without a change to the guide tests.\n\nDone means:\n- `python3 -m unittest discover -s site/tests` passes on `main`.\n- A branch `site/v0.27.0` from the tag has the same site-only fix, and a `site_only` dispatch of `release.yml` deploys \"CamCraft 0.27.0\".\n",
